# =============================================================
# CodeAudit-X .gitignore
# Goal: the public repo should contain exactly what a reviewer
# needs to understand and reproduce the paper:
#   - probe library, notebooks, notes
#   - mitigation scripts / configs / tools
#   - the run registry, comparison verdicts, manifests, structure docs
# and NOT the multi-thousand-file raw generation dumps, copyrighted
# source PDFs, private review notes, or local environment cruft.
# =============================================================

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Virtual environments ---
venv/
.venv/
env/
ENV/
.python-version

# --- Secrets / local config (never publish) ---
.env
.env.*
*.local
secrets.*
*credentials*
*.pem
*.key

# --- Model weights / caches (large, regenerated, not source) ---
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.onnx
*.h5
.cache/
hf_cache/
models_cache/

# --- Raw per-seed experiment outputs (bloat: ~8k files) ---
# Reviewers use the registry + comparison JSONs + manifests instead.
# The small paper-referenced index/spec files are re-included below.
Codes/mitigation/runs/
Codes/outputs/**/runs/
Codes/outputs/**/baseline/
**/ast_extract/
**/generated/

# --- Probe-expansion sweep: raw outputs + per-run metric dumps ---
# Regenerated by Codes/analysis/expansion/run_expansion.py; the consolidated
# results live in Codes/analysis/expansion/out/*.csv. runs_clean/ is the
# robust re-extraction, reproducible from runs/ via reextract.py.
Codes/analysis/expansion/runs/
Codes/analysis/expansion/runs_clean/

# --- Local operational run-drivers (hardcode machine paths; not for repro) ---
Codes/analysis/expansion/chain_qwen.sh
Codes/analysis/expansion/post_analysis.sh

# Re-include the small, paper-referenced index/spec files even though
# they live under otherwise-ignored output trees:
!Codes/outputs/STRUCTURE.md
!Codes/outputs/run_manifest_all.csv
!Codes/outputs/**/manifests/
!Codes/outputs/**/manifests/**

# --- Copyrighted third-party PDFs (do not redistribute) ---
# The 21 reviewed papers are cited in the bibliography; reviewers
# access them via their DOIs / arXiv links, not from this repo.
Papers/
*.pdf

# --- Private working documents (not for the public repo) ---
PAPER_REVISION_PLAN.md
paper.md

# --- Internal progress trackers (kept local, not for the public repo) ---
PHASE_STATUS.md
Codes/mitigation/CHANGELOG_PHASE3.md
Codes/mitigation/walkthrough_phase3.md
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.synctex.gz

# --- Tooling / agent / IDE internals ---
.claude/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml

# --- OS files ---
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# --- Presentation material (was already excluded) ---
Presentation/
CodeAudit\ X\ -\ Presentation.pdf
